{
  "id": "genome_traits_v1",
  "scope": "Bacterial and archaeal growth temperature, oxygen use and host association predicted from genome-level traits (GC, genome size, coding density, proteins per Mb), across GTDB species with a trait record. Says nothing about gene content or protein sequence.",
  "model": "Ridge (temperature) / logistic (oxygen, host) on standardized genome features; gradient boosting on the same features reported next to it; taxonomy memorisation as the baseline.",
